 "agree": [],
 "scope": [
  "X_ITE 16.6.0 does nothing with this node (not supported), so the stream is checked against Web Audio only, in our reader; the stream is read back inside the same page (not sent over a network); mediaDeviceID has no meaning for a stream and is held; how a page uses the stream (a WebRTC connection, a recorder) is the page's business"
 ]
